 {
  "id": "615ac73ff8c8c6003aa3e65d",
  "name": "Widget - Recenzii Clienti ENG",
  "type": "entrust-widget",
  "payload": {
   "title": "Over 19 years <br>of successful cooperation",
   "description": "We make long and complex processes dozens of times simpler. Find out how RTI's services and equipment contribute to the proper functioning and development of business.",
   "slides": [
    {
     "image": {
      "mimetype": "image/png",
      "path": "public/widgets/files/d116688c-d12e-4783-9b58-a849f2522b1f.png"
     },
     "description": "We have had a beautiful collaboration with RTI for 10 years. During this period, we launched many projects, the last of which was Gourmet Fourchette. Our cooperation consists in the supply and installation of fiscal equipment, scales and IT networks. I confidently recommend RTI to all economic agents.",
     "author": "Adrian Lazarenco",
     "job": "CEO of the store network ",
     "company": "Gourmet Fourchette",
     "video": {
      "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uSTHbXbwI2I",
      "image": {
       "mimetype": "image/jpeg",
       "path": "public/widgets/files/bcc09c58-95a5-4104-a005-a9f38015af18.jpg"
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "image": {
      "mimetype": "image/png",
      "path": "public/widgets/files/750454b5-1aee-4a9b-a5d9-dba1b215985d.png"
     },
     "description": "We have been working with RTI since the launch of the business. We are very pleased with our collaboration. I confidently recommend all companies operating in the field of restaurants and hotels use RTI services.",
     "author": "Mihai Tanase",
     "job": "CEO of ",
     "company": "BERD'S Hotel",
     "video": {
      "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DOvqtWMoZ_U",
      "image": {
       "mimetype": "image/png",
       "path": "public/widgets/files/8b6e26ad-8c98-46f7-b4bf-aa767dc93162.png"
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "image": {
      "mimetype": "image/png",
      "path": "public/widgets/files/4f6bf283-c608-426d-be9f-fbb72c2fd419.png"
     },
     "description": "Due to the business process management system implemented by the RTI company, which includes equipment and software, our pastry shop obtains the highest quality results in finance and management processes.",
     "author": "Dmitrii Bucicov",
     "job": "Co-founder of the ",
     "company": "Covrigo pastry network",
     "video": {
      "url": "https://youtu.be/watch?v=M3LiHbD9uI4",
      "image": {
       "mimetype": "image/png",
       "path": "public/widgets/files/6c403583-6484-42cf-b46c-c27b6957b3d6.png"
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "image": {
      "mimetype": "image/webp",
      "path": "public/widgets/files/6cb642f6-bc38-4b2b-867b-9ca89eef6a3b.webp"
     },
     "description": "Black Rabbit restaurant has chosen the iiko management solution because it is an all-in-one program that integrates sales, purchases and all reports into one system. All financial operations and accounting are centralized.",
     "author": "Ecaterina Zidu",
     "job": "Manager",
     "company": "Black Rabbit Gastro-Burrow restaurant",
     "video": {
      "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iUUP_nweJ5k",
      "image": {
       "mimetype": "image/jpeg",
       "path": "public/widgets/files/799c8dc7-ea19-4e1b-a9da-4e74218d23a3.jpg"
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "image": {
      "mimetype": "image/webp",
      "path": "public/widgets/files/2da0f73d-e4ba-416f-8e9f-7b60f2936b80.webp"
     },
     "description": "RTI has provided us with complete solutions to facilitate the management and control of the DRAFT brewery network. This allows us to be ready to respond to all changes and effectively manage the network remotely. I recommend all RTI services.",
     "author": "Roman Zaitev",
     "job": "Commercial Director",
